<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Kali Ma"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Neck Deep"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Life’s Not Out to Get You"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USHR21579004"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="33933848"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="102948303"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="4HsWOiIPuQ6tCT3suvGWMK"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1716631799"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Fifty-Four54"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:42.450"><div begin="20.900" end="2:42.450"><p begin="20.900" end="25.200" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.900" end="22.800">Sit still</span> <span begin="22.850" end="23.150">in</span> <span begin="23.200" end="23.300">the</span> <span begin="23.350" end="25.200">cold of February</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">静静坐在二月的寒冷里</span></p><p begin="25.250" end="29.550" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.250" end="25.700">Hold my</span> <span begin="25.710" end="26.200">hand in</span> <span begin="26.230" end="27.450">the cemetery</span> <span begin="27.450" end="27.800">and you&apos;ll</span> <span begin="27.900" end="29.550">be safe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在墓园牵着我的手吧，你会安全的</span></p><p begin="30.000" end="34.520" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.000" end="30.450">And I</span> <span begin="30.500" end="30.930">know</span> <span begin="31.150" end="32.050">that</span> <span begin="32.290" end="32.690">this is</span> <span begin="32.750" end="34.520">only temporary</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道这一切都只是暂时</span></p><p begin="34.520" end="39.020" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.520" end="34.980">And I</span> <span begin="35.050" end="35.740">don&apos;t think</span> <span begin="35.760" end="36.220">that it&apos;s</span> <span begin="36.220" end="36.900">helping</span> <span begin="37.000" end="39.020">anything</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我也不觉得这能改变什么</span></p><p begin="39.450" end="44.100" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.450" end="39.900">And it&apos;s</span> <span begin="39.900" end="40.580">all fun</span> <span begin="40.580" end="41.440">and games</span> <span begin="41.440" end="42.000">until</span> <span begin="42.000" end="43.000">someone</span> <span begin="43.110" end="43.380">gets</span> <span begin="43.430" end="44.100">fucked up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一切在出事前都像场游戏，可最后总会有人被伤得体无完肤</span></p><p begin="44.260" end="46.150" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.260" end="44.850">This will</span> <span begin="44.930" end="45.620">end in</span> <span begin="45.670" end="46.150">tears</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">结局注定以眼泪收场</span></p><p begin="46.200" end="49.500" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.200" end="46.810">I could</span> <span begin="46.810" end="47.730">never</span> <span begin="47.730" end="48.900">be enough</span> <span begin="48.900" end="49.500">for you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我永远无法真正让你满足</span></p><p begin="49.840" end="54.400" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.840" end="50.330">Count my</span> <span begin="50.420" end="51.925">blessings on one hand</span> <span begin="52.150" end="53.560">and my curses on</span> <span begin="53.600" end="54.400">the other</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我一只手数着仅剩的幸运，另一只手数着自己的诅咒</span></p><p begin="54.420" end="56.850" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.420" end="55.000">I let you</span> <span begin="55.000" end="55.360">slip</span> <span begin="55.360" end="55.830">between</span> <span begin="55.830" end="56.850">my fingers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我让你从指缝间溜走</span></p><p begin="56.870" end="58.820" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="56.870" end="57.600">Hide away</span> <span begin="57.600" end="58.250">until</span> <span begin="58.290" end="58.820">the summer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后躲起来，直到夏天来临</span></p><p begin="58.600" end="1:00.600" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.600" end="59.280">Kali Ma</span> <span begin="59.280" end="59.610">lean</span> <span begin="59.620" end="1:00.600">over me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">迦梨女神，俯身靠近我吧</span></p><p begin="1:00.900" end="1:03.100" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.900" end="1:01.650">Rip your hand</span> <span begin="1:01.650" end="1:02.470">into my</span> <span begin="1:02.470" end="1:03.100">chest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把手伸进我的胸膛</span></p><p begin="1:03.170" end="1:05.750" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.170" end="1:03.670">Pull out my</span> <span begin="1:03.730" end="1:04.620">beating heart</span> <span begin="1:04.630" end="1:05.750">for the world to see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将我仍在跳动的心脏掏出来给全世界看</span></p><p begin="1:05.820" end="1:07.400" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.820" end="1:06.590">Then send me</span> <span begin="1:06.630" end="1:07.400">down to hell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后把我送下地狱</span></p><p begin="1:07.400" end="1:09.400" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.400" end="1:08.340">You ignore</span> <span begin="1:08.400" end="1:09.400">my pleas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你无视我的哀求</span></p><p begin="1:09.750" end="1:16.640" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.750" end="1:10.720">Indiana</span> <span begin="1:10.790" end="1:11.230">couldn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:11.230" end="1:11.950">save me</span> <span begin="1:11.990" end="1:13.270">so I guess</span> <span begin="1:13.270" end="1:14.200">I&apos;ll save</span> <span begin="1:14.280" end="1:16.640">myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连印第安纳都救不了我，所以我想只能由我自己拯救自己了</span></p><p begin="1:26.470" end="1:30.750" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.470" end="1:27.500">We hopped from bench</span> <span begin="1:27.520" end="1:28.310">to bench</span> <span begin="1:28.450" end="1:30.750">in the middle of our town</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们在小镇中央，从一张长椅跳到另一张长椅</span></p><p begin="1:30.780" end="1:35.280" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.780" end="1:31.800">Where the streetlights</span> <span begin="1:31.850" end="1:32.830">hit your eyes</span> <span begin="1:32.830" end="1:33.400">and then</span> <span begin="1:33.400" end="1:34.100">the tears came</span> <span begin="1:34.160" end="1:35.280">falling down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">街灯映进你的眼睛，接着眼泪便落了下来</span></p><p begin="1:35.780" end="1:39.710" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.780" end="1:36.350">The love</span> <span begin="1:36.400" end="1:37.650">that you confessed</span> <span begin="1:37.650" end="1:38.250">the product</span> <span begin="1:38.250" end="1:38.830">of your</span> <span begin="1:38.880" end="1:39.710">loneliness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你口中的爱,不过是孤独催生出的产物</span></p><p begin="1:39.710" end="1:44.260" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.710" end="1:40.300">I see</span> <span begin="1:40.350" end="1:41.780">right through you</span> <span begin="1:42.240" end="1:43.310">but what do I</span> <span begin="1:43.330" end="1:44.260">do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我其实早就看透了你，可我又能怎么办？</span></p><p begin="1:44.730" end="1:49.400" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.730" end="1:45.800">Of course I fall</span> <span begin="1:45.870" end="1:46.730">for it</span><span begin="1:46.900" end="1:47.900">just like I did</span> <span begin="1:47.900" end="1:49.400">when I was sixteen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我当然还是会再次沦陷，就像十六岁那年一样</span></p><p begin="1:49.550" end="1:51.400" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.550" end="1:49.990">Such a</span> <span begin="1:50.140" end="1:51.400">fool for you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为了你，我真像个傻子</span></p><p begin="1:51.850" end="1:54.130" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.850" end="1:52.360">Did you</span> <span begin="1:52.360" end="1:53.380">ever even</span> <span begin="1:53.380" end="1:54.130">miss me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你真的有想念过我吗？我很怀疑</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:54.200" end="1:54.740"><span begin="1:54.200" end="1:54.740">(Doubt it)</span></span></p><p begin="1:54.740" end="1:56.800" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.740" end="1:55.420">Kali Ma</span> <span begin="1:55.430" end="1:55.790">lean</span> <span begin="1:55.850" end="1:56.800">over me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">迦梨女神，俯身靠近我吧</span></p><p begin="1:57.150" end="1:59.260" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.150" end="1:57.860">Rip your hand</span> <span begin="1:57.860" end="1:59.260">into my chest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把手伸进我的胸膛</span></p><p begin="1:59.300" end="2:01.850" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.300" end="1:59.880">Pull out my</span> <span begin="1:59.900" end="2:00.760">beating heart</span> <span begin="2:00.790" end="2:01.290">for the world</span> <span begin="2:01.300" end="2:01.850">to see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将我跳动的心脏掏出来给全世界看</span></p><p begin="2:01.950" end="2:03.630" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.950" end="2:02.770">Then send me</span> <span begin="2:02.830" end="2:03.630">down to hell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后把我送下地狱</span></p><p begin="2:03.680" end="2:05.550" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.680" end="2:04.520">You ignore</span> <span begin="2:04.590" end="2:05.550">my pleas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你无视我的哀求</span></p><p begin="2:05.930" end="2:08.100" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.930" end="2:06.890">Indiana</span> <span begin="2:06.960" end="2:07.350">couldn&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:07.350" end="2:08.100">save me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连印第安纳都救不了我</span></p><p begin="2:08.130" end="2:13.000" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.130" end="2:09.450">So I guess</span> <span begin="2:09.450" end="2:10.500">I&apos;ll save</span> <span begin="2:10.550" end="2:13.000">myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以我只能自己救自己</span></p><p begin="2:13.450" end="2:15.500" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.450" end="2:14.100">Kali Ma</span> <span begin="2:14.200" end="2:15.500">lean over me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">迦梨女神，俯身靠近我吧</span></p><p begin="2:15.900" end="2:18.020" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.900" end="2:16.590">Rip your hand</span> <span begin="2:16.590" end="2:17.150">into</span> <span begin="2:17.150" end="2:18.020">my chest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把手伸进我的胸膛</span></p><p begin="2:18.100" end="2:20.650" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.100" end="2:18.570">Pull out my</span> <span begin="2:18.600" end="2:19.500">beating heart</span> <span begin="2:19.520" end="2:20.650">for the world to see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将我仍在跳动的心脏掏出来给全世界看</span></p><p begin="2:20.800" end="2:24.400" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.800" end="2:21.670">Oh won&apos;t you</span> <span begin="2:21.720" end="2:22.850">go to</span> <span begin="2:22.900" end="2:24.400">hell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哦，你怎么不干脆下地狱？</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:26.990" end="2:27.990"><span begin="2:26.990" end="2:27.990">(Go to hell)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">下地狱吧！</span></span></p><p begin="2:32.700" end="2:37.510" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:32.700" end="2:33.230">You&apos;re gonna</span> <span begin="2:33.300" end="2:33.980">get killed</span> <span begin="2:34.000" end="2:34.990">chasing after</span> <span begin="2:35.000" end="2:35.680">your damn</span> <span begin="2:35.790" end="2:37.510">fortune and glory</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你迟早会为了追逐你那该死的荣耀和名利而送命</span></p><p begin="2:37.550" end="2:40.350" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.550" end="2:38.420">Maybe I</span> <span begin="2:38.630" end="2:38.900">maybe</span> <span begin="2:38.930" end="2:40.350">I will</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也许吧，也许我会</span></p><p begin="2:40.730" end="2:42.450" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.730" end="2:41.200">but not</span> <span begin="2:41.230" end="2:42.450">today</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但不是今天！</span></p></div></body></tt>